abstract: >-
  Certified minimum-cost scheduler refinement for arbitrary control-labelled
  transition systems, with persistent policies, closed-set certificates,
  checked abstraction transfer, invariant-guided refinement, coupled BFT-rule
  models, structural quorum specializations, and unchanged-client conformance.
